mory with photos 3|'ll see \/ I've seen of the","h":0.01328122010988031,"x":0.066518856192064005,"y":0.30668604675687505,"w":0.34368068695068354},{"h":0.011656453293396152,"y":0.31976744211163355,"w":0.38580928802490233,"text":"same events. But 4l'd \/ I've asked my mum about it","x":0.06430155798311446},{"text":"and she agrees that my memories are accurate.","w":0.35698448181152342,"x":0.06651885003104524,"y":0.33428805222796409,"h":0.011642180175906125},{"y":0.34738134216193728,"text":"For some of them, there's no photographic","x":0.066518852020147248,"h":0.013093289298823918,"w":0.32372505187988282},{"y":0.36046511608827048,"text":"evidence or anything that 5 could \/ could have","x":0.066518859074547299,"h":0.013102804970624216,"w":0.34368068695068354},{"text":"jogged my memory, so I believe they're real.","y":0.37500000011806711,"h":0.01308139529438912,"w":0.33924610137939459,"x":0.064301557043118823},{"x":0.01995566555164487,"y":0.41407528643409264,"h":0.013250295152055447,"w":0.41463413238525393,"text":"2 Complete the extract from the recording with the"},{"h":0.011627906668205679,"x":0.042128596751296855,"text":"words in the box. There are two extra words.","y":0.42877906972791269,"w":0.35698448181152342},{"h":0.013143245600249265,"y":0.45494186041966578,"w":0.29268291473388669,"x":0.062084266180728417,"text":"confused jogged losing manages"},{"w":0.075388026237487804,"h":0.0087209301962594132,"y":0.47093023246727728,"x":0.062084257668395787,"text":"memories"},{"text":"remember recall vague","x":0.15055459040512481,"w":0.208939266204834,"y":0.46715533773869233,"h":0.015872167097175982},{"w":0.24390243530273442,"h":0.010326666059353617,"text":"Extract from Student's Book recording","x":0.068736146816481949,"y":0.50726744208727381},{"x":0.033192266621990874,"text":"Speaker 2","y":0.52596811926991183,"h":0.012017250061035156,"w":0.077739634513854974},{"w":0.38137470245361332,"x":0.068736150547029348,"y":0.53924418585571232,"h":0.013128973263180188,"text":"Most people in my family have rubbish memories,"},{"h":0.011865793780687417,"w":0.36807094573974614,"text":"but my grandfather's amazing. He's not like other","x":0.068736149436113572,"y":0.55360065472431552},{"h":0.013247915648789688,"y":0.56669394457107936,"text":"old people who are '","w":0.15964522361755373,"x":0.066518853970971778},{"text":"their memory","y":0.5690476814909845,"x":0.32127425706921386,"w":0.10259514808654785,"h":0.0097019282183358202},{"h":0.011627906668205679,"text":"- he's really switched on. He","x":0.23281596812821748,"w":0.21507759094238282,"y":0.58139534908837776},{"x":0.066518853515936172,"w":0.36807094573974614,"text":"remembers dates and names and places. He can","y":0.5957446808179957,"h":0.011865793780687306},{"h":0.013255052597745065,"w":0.23281595230102536,"text":"in detail events that happened","y":0.6088379707943623,"x":0.21064302326744738},{"x":0.066518852972912976,"text":"50 years ago - and he's 77! I'm 16 and I can't","y":0.62354651181851339,"h":0.011627906668205679,"w":0.34146339416503907},{"text":"what I did yesterday! I wish I had his","w":0.27494455337524415,"h":0.011627906668205679,"x":0.16851441496056729,"y":0.63662790722791263},{"w":0.34811527252197266,"y":0.64970930213478217,"h":0.013138488154559536,"text":"memory - it would help me a lot in my exams.","x":0.066518858971829645},{"x":0.064301554740672257,"h":0.014534883140151944,"text":"I asked him how he 5","w":0.16186252593994141,"y":0.66279069778312161},{"y":0.66388916748084792,"x":0.31920054170019863,"w":0.10439270973205561,"text":"to remember","h":0.012337943731080103},{"x":0.066518848494200034,"h":0.011627906668205679,"y":0.67877907011550953,"text":"things so well, and he","w":0.16629711151123047},{"text":"drinks green tea!","h":0.011865793780687306,"y":0.70621931272041627,"w":0.12638580322265625,"x":0.068736144813283856},{"y":0.71931260240199024,"w":0.16186252593994144,"x":0.066518849513399564,"h":0.010338560063788194,"text":"I think it's because he"},{"text":"reads a lot and stays","x":0.066518852239255993,"y":0.73401162820659482,"w":0.15742793083190917,"h":0.011627906668205679},{"h":0.013136109431714726,"text":"active. He walks every","x":0.066518853875213557,"y":0.74709302325881322,"w":0.16851440429687498},{"h":0.01162790666820579,"w":0.16186252593994138,"x":0.068736145492704723,"text":"day - he's much fitter","y":0.76017441871047076},{"text":"REMEMBER THIS","x":0.031042129128419339,"y":0.81831395384236094,"h":0.010245784409892988,"w":0.14412416458129884},{"text":"Different phrases can be used to talk about memory:","w":0.39467849731445315,"h":0.013176550061339887,"y":0.84156976768710767,"x":0.03325941690079276},{"x":0.039911308862805618,"text":"• for remembering - bear something in mind, learn by","h":0.013081395294389231,"w":0.41463413238525387,"y":0.8619186044603635},{"text":"heart, think back to something, ring a bell.","w":0.31929044723510741,"x":0.055432376382446476,"h":0.011627906668205679,"y":0.87790697689845532},{"w":0.37694011688232421,"x":0.057649680195201364,"h":0.013266946992390283,"text":"We're studying the table of elements in Chemistry","y":0.89098837206574155},{"h":0.01162790666820579,"text":"and we have to learn it by heart.","w":0.24168514251708983,"x":0.057649672237389885,"y":0.90697674429186614},{"text":"• for forgetting - slip your mind, escape you, draw a blank.","x":0.039911325790046491,"w":0.42572059631347658,"h":0.013247916429210638,"y":0.92005813950760185},{"text":"I'm sorry I didn't call you - it slipped my mind.","x":0.055432391713884144,"h":0.013140866877404456,"w":0.34811527252197266,"y":0.93453355167579799},{"h":0.013107562416313945,"text":"3 Read REMEMBER THIS. Complete the phrases with","x":0.49445676960131152,"y":0.07119476306518302,"w":0.43902439117431641},{"h":0.011865793780687417,"x":0.52328160660362033,"w":0.17516628265380874,"y":0.087152209619680288,"text":"the words in the box."},{"y":0.28488372101182735,"text":"4","w":0.019955654144287127,"x":0.49445676297774555,"h":0.0116279066682056