h in mind -to remember sth","w":0.23503326416015624,"h":0.010248163132737798,"y":0.22093023276677959},{"y":0.23527004913607708,"h":0.010369485411823476,"w":0.23725055694580077,"x":0.64966740741956075,"text":"a blank - to be unable to"},{"y":0.25000000011504864,"x":0.76496673914109348,"h":0.0087209301962594132,"w":0.11086474418640135,"text":"remember sth"},{"x":0.52549889330118971,"h":0.011651695457496003,"w":0.090909090042114227,"text":"6 to ring a","y":0.26453488377830026},{"text":"- to sound familiar","y":0.26308139569690492,"x":0.75388026704416222,"w":0.14412416458129884,"h":0.011627906668205679},{"y":0.28477905069420051,"h":0.011865793780687417,"text":"Complete the sentences with the correct form of","w":0.39467849731445315,"x":0.52328158733686081},{"text":"the words and phrases in Exercise 3.","x":0.52328160300298387,"y":0.29941860489641003,"w":0.29490020751953128,"h":0.013183686229874425},{"text":"I should be able to remember his address, but it","y":0.31423888650928777,"x":0.54970242689334436,"w":0.36845935821533204,"h":0.016169869568070983},{"text":"escapes me.","h":0.0087352033137495511,"x":0.55210643389507219,"w":0.0953436756134034,"y":0.33428805244571747},{"y":0.34574468082060927,"text":"1 Can you","x":0.52549889123171456,"w":0.090909090042114227,"h":0.011865793780687417},{"w":0.17516628265380862,"x":0.75388027319637729,"y":0.34574468081799581,"h":0.011865793780687417,"text":"to that day and tell me"},{"text":"what happened?","x":0.54988913578476672,"y":0.36046511646981116,"h":0.013102804970624216,"w":0.13082039833068848},{"y":0.37500000011174084,"text":"2","h":0.010174418042022237,"x":0.52549889116371018,"w":0.011086474657058698},{"h":0.011627906668205679,"text":"that it'll take a few hours to drive","x":0.68514412988894746,"y":0.37354651158837782,"w":0.25277160644531249},{"text":"there, so leave early.","h":0.011637422340005976,"x":0.54988913884082014,"y":0.38952536820339922,"w":0.16186252593994133},{"y":0.40406976742367251,"w":0.13968957901000978,"h":0